# Production build settings (read by `vite build`). Site keys are public,
# so this file is committed. Uncomment and paste the SITE key from your
# Cloudflare Turnstile widget (never the secret key, which goes in
# `pnpm prod:secrets`). `pnpm prod:deploy` refuses to deploy without it.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=
